                                                "sense_id": "0aec47b0-d6fe-3009-bf2d-accd70e5ed6c",
                                                "text": "A finer point to observe is that the sample implementation provided in Example 7-4 adjusts the IDF score by adding a value of 1.0 to the logarithm calculation, for the purposes of illustration and because we're dealing with a trivial document set."
                                            },
                                            {
