                                                "sense_id": "0aec47b0-d6fe-3009-bf2d-accd70e5ed6c",
                                                "text": "The idea behind inverse document frequency (IDF) is that all words in the corpus are not equally important."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "448d28da-ef0e-47e8-beeb-b28f9fd2abce",
                                                "sense_id": "0aec47b0-d6fe-3009-bf2d-accd70e5ed6c",
                                                "text": "Inverse document frequency, or IDF, is your window through Zipf in topic analysis."
                                            }
